  customerName: An Undelivered Letter Writer
  request: Pack the letters and ember. Keep the ember away from both paper items.
    Send Express, the upstairs window disappears at dawn.
  storyId: undelivered-letter-writer
  firstVisitStory: "Lucinda kept every letter I sent. When she died, her family returned
    them.\n\nYesterday, a new reply arrived inside the bundle.\n\nShe says she can
    see the post office from her upstairs window. Her house was demolished in 1963.\n\nThe
    envelope was marked \u201CNot yet.\u201D\n\nPlease send these back before dawn.
    I\u2019d like her to know I\u2019m still writing."
  recipient: My Love
  address: 48 Pottsfield Road
  budget: 14
